  {
   "type": "quotes",
   "header": "",
   "slides": [
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/1/e/csm_josua_schade_9179cf0129.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">At ZOLLER, we tailor hardware and software to the user. This enables us to offer practical solutions from a single source.</p> <p><strong>Josua Schade, Product Management TMS Hardware</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/a/b/csm_sarah-michelle_wiacek_c4c06a6999.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">The ZOLLER assembly team in Pleidelsheim, Germany, gives its all every day to ensure the consistently high quality of your Smart Cabinets. Simply being at the top!</p> <p><strong>Sarah-Michelle Wiacek, Work Preparation Team</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    },
    {
     "img": {
      "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/0/9/csm_michael_haas_a5847acaff.webp",
      "alt": ""
     },
     "text": "<p class=\"extra-large-text\">With the Smart Cabinets, our ZOLLER customers not only increase efficiency, but also avoid errors in the ongoing production process.</p> <p><strong>Michael Haas, Sales ZOLLER South</strong></p>",
     "right": true,
     "quote": true,
     "dark": true
    }
   ],
